{"tool_name":"spotfinderz","contents":["neubias"],"fetched_metadata":{"neubias":{"body":[{"format":"basic_html","processed":"<p>Quote: *SpotFinderZ (from now on simply SpotFinder) detects round, usually diffraction-limited spots inside bacterial cells outlined with MicrobeTracker and places them into the meshes structure produced by MicrobeTracker. The program is written in MATLAB and saves the data in the MicrobeTracker format by appending additional fields.*</p>","summary":"","value":"<p>Quote: *SpotFinderZ (from now on simply SpotFinder) detects round, usually diffraction-limited spots inside bacterial cells outlined with MicrobeTracker and places them into the meshes structure produced by MicrobeTracker. The program is written in MATLAB and saves the data in the MicrobeTracker format by appending additional fields.*</p>\r\n"}],"changed":[{"format":"Y-m-d\\TH:i:sP","value":"2019-10-21T12:54:08+00:00"}],"created":[{"format":"Y-m-d\\TH:i:sP","value":"2014-12-15T23:45:40+00:00"}],"default_langcode":[{"value":true}],"attribution_instructions":[],"comments_2023":[],"free_tagging":[],"give_feedback_on_this_soft":[{"cid":0,"comment_count":0,"last_comment_name":null,"last_comment_timestamp":1505209951,"last_comment_uid":164,"status":2}],"has_author":[],"has_biological_terms":[{"target_id":4645,"target_type":"taxonomy_term","target_uuid":"2f1a6d6d-5861-44b5-abfb-0f2224974797","url":"/taxonomy/term/4645"}],"has_comparison":[],"has_documentation":[{"options":[],"title":"","uri":"http://microbetracker.org/help/helpSpotFinder.htm"}],"has_doi":[],"has_entry_curator":[{"target_id":94,"target_type":"user","target_uuid":"aa749c9e-5b9a-4fdf-83ce-6b94538fe57c","url":"/user/94"}],"has_function":[{"target_id":4023,"target_type":"taxonomy_term","target_uuid":"http://edamontology.org/operation_Image_tracking","url":"/object-tracking"}],"has_implementation":[],"has_interaction_level":[{"target_id":3590,"target_type":"taxonomy_term","target_uuid":"9865a371-85fd-4c86-b22d-6a15949acb5f","u